<!-- The accent picker, drawn as the row of dots it really is (MetroDialog.singleChoice prefixes each
     row with a 16dp circle): three swatches, the middle one picked — so the filled dot is the one the
     user is standing on. Same 24-unit line art as the tour glyphs, white so it is tinted at the usage
     site. Pitch and radius are set so the strokes never touch: 7.4 units between centres, 2.7 radius. -->
